ic human rights  to all of our people because the  government isn't going to change  unless the voices of canadians and  indigenous people  speak up and make the government pause  and listen  and then change will come  next week on the new reality there is  just a  a lot of people that are succumbing to  false information because of covid and  us being in isolation a lot of people  are curious  they're alone so they're turning to  communities on the internet  people who tout conspiracy theory they  actually take advantage of people's  fears i don't feel it's wise to leave  these  people speaking unchecked it's  frightening it's  absolutely frightening  [Music]  that is the new reality for this week  i'm donna friesen  thanks for joining us  [Music]  you

